---
layout: base.njk
section: vision
permalink: /vision/
extraStyles:
  - vision.css
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Our Vision"
  description: "The vision behind AntarikshPedia — a connected encyclopedia of space exploration."
---

<section class="vision-hero">
  <canvas id="vision-stars" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <p class="vision-kicker">The vision</p>
  <h1>Not a catalog.<br><em>A connected story.</em></h1>
  <p class="vision-hook">
    Space exploration was never a list of launches. It is a single unbroken
    story — of agencies and machines, of rivalries and handshakes, of ideas
    igniting ideas across seven decades. AntarikshPedia exists so anyone can
    follow that story the way it actually happened: one web of missions,
    people, and events shaping one another.
  </p>
  {% set sorted = missions | sortByYear %}
  <dl class="vision-stats" aria-label="Dataset statistics">
    <div><dt class="stat-label">Missions</dt><dd class="stat-num" data-count="{{ missions | length }}">{{ missions | length }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="stat-label">Agencies</dt><dd class="stat-num" data-count="{{ agencies | length }}">{{ agencies | length }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="stat-label">Countries &amp; entities</dt><dd class="stat-num" data-count="{{ countries | length }}">{{ countries | length }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt class="stat-label">Years covered</dt><dd class="stat-num" data-count="{{ (sorted | last).year - (sorted | first).year + 1 }}">{{ (sorted | last).year - (sorted | first).year + 1 }}</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="vision-section">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>One knowledge network</h2><span class="mono-tag">the model</span></div>
  <ol class="constellation reveal" role="list">
    {% for step in ['Agency', 'Program', 'Mission', 'Spacecraft', 'Instruments', 'Events', 'Discoveries', 'Publications'] %}
      <li class="node" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
        <span class="node-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="node-label">{{ step }}</span>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p class="constellation-caption">
    Every page is a node. Every mission links back to its agency, its
    program, its machines — and forward to what they made possible.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="vision-section">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>How it grows</h2><span class="mono-tag">roadmap</span></div>
  <div class="phase-grid">
    <article class="phase-card now reveal">
      <span class="phase-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <span class="phase-tag"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Phase 1 — now</span>
      <h3>Pages for everything in the record</h3>
      <p>A page per mission, agency, and country — generated from one
         canonical dataset, cross-linked automatically.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="phase-card reveal">
      <span class="phase-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <span class="phase-tag">Phase 2 — depth</span>
      <h3>Stories, sources, media</h3>
      <p>Long-form mission histories with verified launch details,
         license-checked imagery, and traceable citations.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="phase-card reveal">
      <span class="phase-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <span class="phase-tag">Phase 3 — community</span>
      <h3>Reviewed contributions</h3>
      <p>Public corrections and additions staged as pending until a reviewer
         approves them against a cited source.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="manifesto reveal">
  <blockquote>
    Earth is the cradle of humanity, but one cannot live in a cradle forever.
  </blockquote>
  <cite><b>Konstantin Tsiolkovsky</b> — 1911</cite>
</section>

<section class="standard-card reveal">
  <span class="mono-tag">editorial standard</span>
  <blockquote>
    Separate sourced fact from interpretation. Present history with clear
    attribution, neutral language, and links to credible sources.
  </blockquote>
  <p class="standard-note">Every AntarikshPedia page is held to this standard.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/catalog/">Explore the record</a>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/scripts/vision.js"></script>
